error[SC0152]: a negative index does not count from the end in Science
  --> tests/ui/parse/negative_index.science:16:21
   |
16 |     let last be row[-1]
   |                     ^^ an index runs from `0` up to the extent
   |
   = note: Python reads `a[-1]` as the last element, which is what makes `a[i - 1]` in a loop read the last element at an `i` of zero instead of failing
   = help: read the last element with: `.last()`

